WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.000
[NAMI] It's enough crying.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.830
And enough sitting around.

4
00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:26.460
It's time to make a decision.

5
00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:29.180
I've got to go.

6
00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:31.340
They're all fighting for me.

7
00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:35.350
[GENZO] Please breathe!

8
00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:46.650
You need to come back now before
it's too late... for your friends.

9
00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:53.870
[DOCTOR] I must have been dreaming.

10
00:00:53.890 --> 00:00:57.830
For a moment there, I thought
we actually had a chance.

11
00:00:58.430 --> 00:01:01.000
Uh... So what did
that shark guy just do?

12
00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:02.290
I don't know.

13
00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:05.360
It looked like he was just
throwing water around...

14
00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:08.670
... but then they both started to bleed.

15
00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:11.340
I don't even have to touch you...

16
00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:14.220
You humans are so
fragile that I can kill you

17
00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:16.930
just by playing around
with a little water...

18
00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:19.890
That's the difference
between you and me.

19
00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:21.190
Shut up!

20
00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:29.240
[SANJI] He's not kidding.

21
00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:40.290
[SANJI] That's why the shark
is king of the fishmen.

22
00:01:43.340 --> 00:01:45.590
[SANJI] He's on a whole different level.

23
00:01:45.740 --> 00:01:47.550
[ARLONG] You should just die.

24
00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:50.000
Your lives are not worth that much...

25
00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:52.510
There's no one who will
miss you when you're gone?

26
00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:53.470
Arlong!

27
00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:56.100
[JOHNNY and YOSAKU]
It's Nami!

28
00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:58.640
[SANJI] You're here...

29
00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:04.980
[ARLONG] Hey, Nami... I was just teaching one
final lesson to these pathetic little pirates.

30
00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:07.320
What are you doing here?

31
00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:14.410
I'm here to kill you.

32
00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:18.700
Wealth, fame, power...

33
00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:19.490
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,

34
00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:22.870
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates, obtained everything the world has to offer.

35
00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:22.410
attained this and everything else
the world had to offer.

36
00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:25.870
And his dying words drove
countless souls to the seas.

37
00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:26.710
What he said in his final moments drove countless souls to the seas.

38
00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:28.710
You want my treasure?

39
00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:28.750
You can have it!

40
00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:30.500
Go ahead.

41
00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:32.090
I left everything I gathered
together in one place.

42
00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:31.710
Find it!

43
00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:34.300
Everything is right where I left it!

44
00:02:32.090 --> 00:02:34.300
Now you just have to find it!

45
00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:38.800
These words lured
men to the Grand Line

46
00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:41.430
People set their sights on the Grand Line in pursuit of their dreams.

47
00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:41.970
in pursuit of dreams greater than
they'd ever dared to imagine!

48
00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:44.680
The world has truly entered the Great Pirate Era!

49
00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:44.900
This is the time known as
the Great Pirate Era!

50
00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:50.690
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

51
00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:56.490
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

52
00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:57.740
One Piece!

53
00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:07.750
Compasses? Not for me. Left them all behind

54
00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:13.550
I'm headed out to sea, with my heart serving as guide

55
00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:19.590
Following the ancient map to the spot marked "X" reveals

56
00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:24.810
Yeah, it's only legendary till someone proves it's real

57
00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:28.760
When the world's got you down,

58
00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:31.900
lean on your crew, they'll turn it around

59
00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:37.240
Their biorhythm will carry you through

60
00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:39.280
We're gonna make the most of it

61
00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:46.450
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

62
00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:52.040
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

63
00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:55.090
Got some change to my name,

64
00:03:55.090 --> 00:03:58.300
and maybe you wanna be my friend?

65
00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:03.180
We are, we are on the cruise!

66
00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:04.810
WE ARE!

67
00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:09.020
<b>My Turn</b>

68
00:04:07.270 --> 00:04:09.650
[ARLONG] Me?

69
00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:11.270
You want to kill me?

70
00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:18.360
[laughs] Haven't you
learned your lesson yet?

71
00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:23.120
How many times have you tried
to kill me in these last eight years?

72
00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:23.950
[men gasp]

73
00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:29.670
[ARLONG] You've tried assassination,
poison, sneak attacks...

74
00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:36.090
[ARLONG] You must be aware that
you mere humans can't kill me.

75
00:04:36.990 --> 00:04:41.180
Now, listen. I won't put you
in the ground, Nami...

76
00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:45.140
But you can't leave...

77
00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:48.310
You will remain here... with us...

78
00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:51.150
... as our surveyor... forever.

79
00:04:52.840 --> 00:04:55.940
But, as you know,
I'm quite good-natured.

80
00:04:55.940 --> 00:05:01.030
If possible I'd like you to be our
surveyor of your own free will.

81
00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:02.660
[ARLONG chuckles]

82
00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:08.740
[ARLONG] I'm giving you a choice.

83
00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:11.860
I will not take pause in having
my fishmen kill every

84
00:05:11.860 --> 00:05:14.710
living creature on this
island... except for you.

85
00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:17.000
[NAMI gasps]

86
00:05:17.130 --> 00:05:19.380
[ARLONG] But that's only if
you refuse to come back

87
00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:24.470
to the Arlong Pirates and draw
sea charts as one of our own.

88
00:05:25.310 --> 00:05:27.310
And if you decide to come back with us,

89
00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:30.430
I'll be kind and spare
the villagers their lives.

90
00:05:30.980 --> 00:05:31.940
[VILLAGERS gasp]

91
00:05:32.050 --> 00:05:35.820
[ARLONG] But, I can't let
these ingrates live...

92
00:05:35.820 --> 00:05:37.850
They must be made an example of.

93
00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:40.610
So there's only one question...

94
00:05:41.260 --> 00:05:43.700
Will you come with me
and save the people

95
00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:48.070
of Cocoyashi Village,
or be foolish and refuse

96
00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:50.790
my request by fighting alongside them?

97
00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:52.870
It's your choice.

98
00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:55.130
With them, you will be hopeless.

99
00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:58.920
With them, you will die.

100
00:06:01.770 --> 00:06:03.550
[ARLONG] Nami...

101
00:06:03.740 --> 00:06:07.390
Will you come and stand
by my side... or not?

102
00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:12.230
The decision is yours.

103
00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:16.110
[NAMI] This isn't fair...

104
00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:19.480
If I remain friends with Luffy and
the others, everyone will be killed.

105
00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:23.450
But if I go with Arlong, everyone
from the village will be saved.

106
00:06:23.660 --> 00:06:26.450
Their lives depend on my choice.

107
00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:30.410
Not fair!

108
00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:33.250
No matter what she chooses,
he'll never set her free!

109
00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:36.670
[NAMI] But...!

110
00:06:41.340 --> 00:06:42.340
[NAMI] Luffy...

111
00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.050
[NAMI] ... help me.

112
00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:48.100
That's for Nami!

113
00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:55.060
[NAMI] I have to believe in him...

114
00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:00.150
[NAMI] Alright, everyone...

115
00:07:00.260 --> 00:07:02.620
We'll fight to the death! Got it?

116
00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:05.490
[VILLAGERS] Yes!

117
00:07:05.490 --> 00:07:07.620
[VILLAGERS shouting]

118
00:07:13.630 --> 00:07:15.210
Well, then...

119
00:07:15.230 --> 00:07:18.790
It looks like they've
made up their minds.

120
00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:28.680
[NOJIKO] Please live! Please live!

121
00:07:39.940 --> 00:07:40.650
[ARLONG] Hm?

122
00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:42.150
[ARLONG] What?!

123
00:07:46.350 --> 00:07:47.420
Alright...

124
00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:50.290
Now just remove his leg weight.

125
00:07:50.290 --> 00:07:51.700
I see... [grunting]

126
00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:55.610
That's what you meant.

127
00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:56.710
No way!

128
00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:58.710
Luffy's alive!

129
00:07:58.750 --> 00:07:59.780
[NAMI] Uh?

130
00:07:59.780 --> 00:08:01.510
Hey! Hang in there.

131
00:08:01.510 --> 00:08:04.380
You can't give up now!

132
00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:06.420
[LUFFY coughing]

133
00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:16.980
[ZORO] Thirty seconds!

134
00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:18.560
That's all I got.

135
00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:22.400
Zoro!

136
00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:26.720
[SANJI grunts]
That'll be enough!

137
00:08:26.720 --> 00:08:28.950
[ARLONG] There isn't
a fountain over there.

138
00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:31.530
Could it be that rubber man?!

139
00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:40.670
[ZORO] Just stay back... you're not
getting... anywhere near him!

140
00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:42.750
Ahh. Zoro.

141
00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:45.910
I thought I told you
to never say that again.

142
00:08:45.910 --> 00:08:48.630
Now prepare to die!

143
00:08:53.810 --> 00:08:57.420
[SANJI] If I kick and break
that leg weight, he can fight.

144
00:08:57.420 --> 00:09:01.900
Luffy, you're the only
one who can fight now!

145
00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:08.440
[ARLONG] In the sea,
one with devil fruit powers

146
00:09:08.590 --> 00:09:11.730
is supposed to lose even
the energy to struggle,

147
00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:16.160
not to mention his powers. He will die.

148
00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:21.090
And if he's still alive, well,
that wouldn't be fair...

149
00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:24.290
You okay? Please say you're fine!

150
00:09:24.470 --> 00:09:25.770
Sure... I'm fine.

151
00:09:25.770 --> 00:09:27.670
You scared us!

152
00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:31.090
Where'd your pinwheel go? It was cool.

153
00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:34.760
We've got bigger things
to worry about right now!

154
00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:40.350
[ZORO] Wouldn't be fair? This game hasn't been
fair from the moment we started playing it.

155
00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:41.850
Well, anyways.

156
00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:45.520
If there's a hindrance,
I should be aware of it.

157
00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:46.730
Correct?

158
00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:47.320
[ZORO grunts]

159
00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:49.400
[USOPP] Egg Star!

160
00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:54.530
[USOPP] I've got your back, Zoro!

161
00:09:54.870 --> 00:09:57.330
Big Bro Usopp! He's all right!

162
00:09:57.330 --> 00:10:01.250
How brave! And he got
here just in time.

163
00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:03.250
[USOPP] Go on! Give it to him!

164
00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:05.330
[VILLAGERS] That's where you are?!

165
00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:07.290
He's all right!

166
00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:10.630
Hey, Nami! I beat one of their
leaders. Can you believe it?!

167
00:10:10.880 --> 00:10:13.900
I wiped the smug off his stupid face.

168
00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:16.500
[GENZO] Think... Is there any
way you can free yourself?

169
00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:18.170
Nope. Can't do it.

170
00:10:18.170 --> 00:10:20.470
My energy is way too low...

171
00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:24.310
[NOJIKO] Come on! Come on! Come out!

172
00:10:27.030 --> 00:10:29.190
[JOHNNY] Alright, Cook!

173
00:10:29.300 --> 00:10:32.200
Now if they can just
set big bro Luffy free...

174
00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:35.030
the fishmen will be
runnin' for their lives!

175
00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:36.620
Go Zoro!

176
00:10:37.160 --> 00:10:39.450
[YOSAKU] Take down
Arlong once and for all!

177
00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:41.370
[USOPP] Huh...?

178
00:10:41.390 --> 00:10:42.960
[USOPP] Ha, ha. Okay!

179
00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:47.080
We have to somehow prevent Arlong
from getting into the sea...

180
00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:49.040
I'll just keep him from going anywhere!

181
00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:57.090
[HACHI groans] I...
won't let you have your way...

182
00:10:57.280 --> 00:10:59.640
[USOPP] Hey, Arlong!
I've got a present for you!

183
00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:01.880
[ARLONG] Huh?

184
00:11:01.880 --> 00:11:04.350
Uh! What's he doin'?

185
00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:05.690
He's so brave!

186
00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:09.440
[USOPP] Usopp!

187
00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:11.570
[ARLONG] You seem
to keep standing in my way...

188
00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:11.570
Rubberband of Doom!

189
00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:14.610
I take it you wish to die first, then.

190
00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:16.670
I can take care of that.

191
00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:18.700
Zoro! Now!

192
00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:20.780
What do you think you're doing, Usopp?!

193
00:11:23.400 --> 00:11:24.570
[ZORO] Now's my chance.

194
00:11:24.570 --> 00:11:28.130
All I want is a piece
of that proud nose!

195
00:11:31.760 --> 00:11:33.630
You fool!

196
00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:36.970
It's a proud nose
because it's unbreakable.

197
00:11:38.610 --> 00:11:44.890
If you were at full strength... you may
have been able to give it a little scratch.

198
00:11:48.230 --> 00:11:51.480
[ZORO panting]

199
00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:57.990
[ARLONG chuckles]

200
00:11:57.990 --> 00:12:00.030
Ahh! No!

201
00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:02.720
Look, over there!

202
00:12:02.720 --> 00:12:04.040
[YOSAKU] Hmm? Huh...?

203
00:12:04.550 --> 00:12:07.000
That damn octopus is up!

204
00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:11.540
[YOSAKU] What's he doing?

205
00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:15.100
[HACHI] Uhh?! Seriously?!

206
00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:17.590
I thought the rubber band
was gonna fly at me!

207
00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:18.970
[VILLAGERS] What?!

208
00:12:19.060 --> 00:12:22.010
[USOPP] What?!

209
00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:26.270
[laughing] He saw what
I was aiming for!

210
00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:28.520
But weren't you yelling "Arlong," huh?

211
00:12:29.190 --> 00:12:30.980
[ZORO pants]
Oh, great...

212
00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:33.320
[HACHI] We're not done, Zoro!

213
00:12:33.380 --> 00:12:36.320
You may have put me down,
but it wasn't for good.

214
00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:40.910
Cause I'm still alive, and now
I'm gonna finish off your friend!

215
00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:44.910
[ZORO gasps]

216
00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:49.540
[ARLONG chuckles]
No need to be concerned...

217
00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:51.880
seeing as how you will
all be dead anyway.

218
00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:54.250
[ZORO gasping]

219
00:12:57.090 --> 00:12:59.090
[ALL gasp]

220
00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:01.550
[JOHNNY, YOSAKU] Big Bro!

221
00:13:10.020 --> 00:13:13.440
[SANJI] You've done enough,
Nojiko. Leave the rest to me!

222
00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:18.740
[NOJIKO] A fishman!

223
00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:24.120
[SANJI] Watch out! I'll break
the rock with a kick!

224
00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:30.900
[SANJI] What?!

225
00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:33.440
Octopus... Fritter Frenzy!

226
00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:35.170
No!

227
00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:36.380
[HACHI grunting]

228
00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:43.720
[USOPP] Zoro!

229
00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:45.640
[ZORO grunting]

230
00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:51.390
So, that's it, huh? Way too easy...

231
00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:57.610
[ARLONG] What's with all these bandages?

232
00:13:57.610 --> 00:13:59.650
[ARLONG] Did you have a good fall?

233
00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:00.400
[ZORO screams]

234
00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:02.070
[ARLONG grunts]

235
00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:06.450
[ARLONG] What's this scar...?

236
00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:08.740
[NAMI gasping]

237
00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:11.290
[BOTH crying]

238
00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:16.540
[USOPP whimpers]

239
00:14:20.530 --> 00:14:23.340
[ARLONG] I can't believe he's breathing...

240
00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:26.930
How can he still be alive
with a body like this?

241
00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:40.320
[ARLONG] Is he dying already...?

242
00:14:41.370 --> 00:14:43.570
Am I fighting a wounded man?

243
00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:49.450
Either way, he's about to die...

244
00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:53.290
He's going to die right here and now!

245
00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:56.540
[ZORO groaning]

246
00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:57.710
[laughs]

247
00:14:57.720 --> 00:14:59.000
[ARLONG] Hm?

248
00:15:00.320 --> 00:15:05.300
[ZORO] If a person stays put...
their wounds won't open up...

249
00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:10.220
[ARLONG] Is that right? Do you
find your situation amusing?

250
00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:13.680
[ZORO laughs]

251
00:15:13.810 --> 00:15:16.230
[ZORO] I'm not talking about me.

252
00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:18.520
I'm talking about the Octo-Man.

253
00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:21.230
[ARLONG] What?!

254
00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:26.110
[ZORO] I thought I told you.
We'll win this game!

255
00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:29.120
[HACHI groaning]

256
00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:37.830
[SANJI] That was too close.

257
00:15:43.780 --> 00:15:47.760
[SANJI] You're the one that made this
complicated in the first place!

258
00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:51.550
[NOJIKO] He did it!

259
00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:54.250
[SANJI] It's time
to take care of that shark!

260
00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:57.020
Hurry up, you idiot!

261
00:15:57.020 --> 00:15:59.100
[LUFFY grunting]

262
00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:00.230
Did they free you?

263
00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:03.150
Yes!

264
00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:07.490
[LUFFY yelling]

265
00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:15.200
[LUFFY] I'm back! Ha, ha!

266
00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:17.580
[VILLAGERS cheering]

267
00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:18.980
It's him!

268
00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:21.880
Our hero's back!

269
00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:25.010
[USOPP cheers]

270
00:16:28.360 --> 00:16:29.930
[gasps] Luffy!

271
00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:35.600
[ARLONG] That rubber bastard...

272
00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:38.770
You're... a bit late...

273
00:16:38.770 --> 00:16:39.850
[LUFFY chuckles]

274
00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:41.440
[LUFFY] Zoro!

275
00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:42.310
[ZORO grunts]

276
00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:46.110
Hey! Hold on... what're you...

277
00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:48.450
[LUFFY laughs]

278
00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:50.280
[ZORO screams]

279
00:16:50.290 --> 00:16:52.070
Let's switch!

280
00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:54.740
[ZORO screams]

281
00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:56.660
[ALL] You idiot!

282
00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:59.120
[LUFFY] Gum-Gum...

283
00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:02.130
Bell!

284
00:17:02.130 --> 00:17:03.290
And...

285
00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:05.800
Whip!

286
00:17:05.800 --> 00:17:07.510
[JOHNNY, YOSAKU gasp]

287
00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:14.050
[LUFFY] Gum-Gum...

288
00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:16.010
Pistol!

289
00:17:19.520 --> 00:17:21.850
Gatling!

290
00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:32.740
Yes!

291
00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:39.580
[ALL gasping]

292
00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:51.880
[ARLONG] Is that all you got?

293
00:17:51.890 --> 00:17:54.600
[JOHNNY, YOSAKU] It's not working!

294
00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:57.760
Nope. Just a warm up.

295
00:17:58.150 --> 00:18:01.730
[ZORO groans]
That idiot!

296
00:18:01.730 --> 00:18:02.940
I'm gonna kill him!

297
00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:05.650
[LUFFY grunting]

298
00:18:07.320 --> 00:18:09.110
[ARLONG] What a bunch of fools.

299
00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:11.110
You think you can actually beat me?

300
00:18:11.430 --> 00:18:14.110
You were better off drowning
on the ocean floor.

301
00:18:15.020 --> 00:18:16.950
[LUFFY] No, I don't think so.

302
00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:17.780
I like it up here.

303
00:18:18.760 --> 00:18:20.500
Yep.

304
00:18:23.530 --> 00:18:26.800
Do you not understand my anger?

305
00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:31.130
I saw my brothers crushed like worms.

306
00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:37.100
[ARLONG] You'll realize soon enough that you
should've quite fighting a long time ago.

307
00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:39.920
Do you think Luffy's gonna be ok?

308
00:18:39.920 --> 00:18:43.390
I mean Arlong doesn't seem to be
affected by his attacks at all...

309
00:18:43.590 --> 00:18:47.520
And more importantly, just how
far away do you think Zoro flew?!

310
00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:50.860
Luffy! I've got your back, pal!

311
00:18:50.860 --> 00:18:52.440
[NAMI] No need to worry.

312
00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:03.440
[SANJI] If he loses...
then we'll all... die.

313
00:19:03.440 --> 00:19:05.870
[GENZO] Yeah. We will.

314
00:19:06.070 --> 00:19:10.630
[NOJIKO] If that happens, it's
the end of the East Blue, too...

315
00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:16.840
Do you know what the biggest difference

316
00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:20.960
between you and me is?

317
00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:22.520
The nose?

318
00:19:22.520 --> 00:19:24.390
The jaw?

319
00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:28.720
Umm...? What's he doing?

320
00:19:28.720 --> 00:19:33.150
Uhh... I don't know.

321
00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:34.610
Webbing!

322
00:19:35.740 --> 00:19:37.990
[ARLONG growls]
Species!

323
00:19:38.950 --> 00:19:40.870
[ALL gasping]

324
00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:44.000
[LUFFY yelps]

325
00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:47.460
[ARLONG grunting]

326
00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:48.580
[LUFFY grunts]

327
00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:49.330
[ARLONG yells]

328
00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:50.960
[LUFFY gasps]

329
00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:53.420
Oh, man! I bet that had to be painful.

330
00:19:53.720 --> 00:19:55.670
His teeth must be shattered.

331
00:19:56.970 --> 00:19:59.180
[USOPP gasping]

332
00:19:59.180 --> 00:20:01.890
[JOHNNY, YOSAKU screaming]

333
00:20:01.890 --> 00:20:05.100
[JOHNNY, YOSAKU] He bit
through that stone pillar!

334
00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:07.480
[LUFFY gasping]

335
00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:09.810
[SANJI] Wow...

336
00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:23.660
[ARLONG] You see? This is
the inherent power of fishmen.

337
00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:28.620
I feel sorry for you humans having
been created with such limited power.

338
00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:32.100
We've been on a different level
since the beginning of time.

339
00:20:32.100 --> 00:20:32.950
You are inferior.

340
00:20:32.950 --> 00:20:36.590
It only makes sense for
you to bow before me.

341
00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:47.810
He's right. There's no
way a human could do

342
00:20:47.810 --> 00:20:51.400
something like that. If those
jaws got a hold of you,

343
00:20:51.420 --> 00:20:55.730
they would do a lot more than
just leave some bite marks.

344
00:20:55.730 --> 00:21:00.820
[LUFFY screaming]

345
00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:04.530
He'll snap through your
bones like a butcher!

346
00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:06.750
[ARLONG chuckles]

347
00:21:06.760 --> 00:21:10.170
[LUFFY] Yeah, so what?!

348
00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:11.420
Quit your braggin'!

349
00:21:12.530 --> 00:21:15.550
[LUFFY] You're not that awesome!

350
00:21:16.340 --> 00:21:18.420
[ARLONG] Huh?

351
00:21:18.440 --> 00:21:21.590
Besides, smashing stones with
your teeth isn't that smart.

352
00:21:24.940 --> 00:21:28.340
[YOSAKU] Way to go! You're the
best Big Bro! Tell it like is!

353
00:21:28.340 --> 00:21:31.100
[JOHNNY] Yeah! What idiot
bites a rock anyway?!

354
00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:35.270
Fools... That's not the point.

355
00:21:35.880 --> 00:21:38.900
Every member of the human race
is ignorant and weak...

356
00:21:39.100 --> 00:21:43.410
What good are you if you can't even
pull yourself out of the water?

357
00:21:46.980 --> 00:21:51.620
As a matter of fact, I'm worthless
without my friends to help me out!

358
00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:54.790
[LUFFY laughs]

359
00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:56.090
[NAMI gasps]

360
00:21:56.110 --> 00:21:58.840
Huh? No way... Luffy's a swordsman?

361
00:21:58.840 --> 00:22:02.180
[LUFFY yells]

362
00:22:02.180 --> 00:22:03.890
[LUFFY] Take that! And that!

363
00:22:03.890 --> 00:22:04.850
[ARLONG] Is this a joke?

364
00:22:04.880 --> 00:22:07.100
Whatever it is, it isn't swordplay.

365
00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:10.430
You're just flailing about
like a child playing pirates!

366
00:22:18.210 --> 00:22:20.860
I hope you realize this isn't a game...

367
00:22:20.860 --> 00:22:24.450
[LUFFY yells]

368
00:22:30.250 --> 00:22:33.360
That's enough... Now, die.

369
00:22:33.360 --> 00:22:35.170
[LUFFY] Shut your face!

370
00:22:35.180 --> 00:22:36.460
[ARLONG] Huh?

371
00:22:36.460 --> 00:22:38.380
[ARLONG groans]

372
00:22:49.100 --> 00:22:52.730
[ARLONG grunting]

373
00:22:54.090 --> 00:22:57.980
[VILLAGERS] What?! He just
shattered Arlong's teeth!

374
00:22:57.980 --> 00:23:00.610
[ARLONG groaning]

375
00:23:02.600 --> 00:23:03.770
You're right!

376
00:23:03.770 --> 00:23:06.940
I don't have a clue how to
use a sword, you bastard!

377
00:23:06.940 --> 00:23:09.950
Wait... What exactly is
he trying to say here?

378
00:23:09.950 --> 00:23:11.950
[ZORO grunting]

379
00:23:13.150 --> 00:23:19.130
[LUFFY] I'm a terrible sailor...
I definitely can't cook...

380
00:23:20.200 --> 00:23:22.070
... and I can't even lie!

381
00:23:22.070 --> 00:23:23.380
[USOPP] Hey!

382
00:23:23.710 --> 00:23:28.210
And without my friends to help me,
I would have been dead a long time ago!

383
00:23:28.210 --> 00:23:34.140
[ARLONG laughs] So you fully
admit how pathetic you are?

384
00:23:34.150 --> 00:23:37.550
You may be a fool, but you
certainly are honest.

385
00:23:37.550 --> 00:23:42.480
How must your crew feel, tolerating
this idiocy day in and day out?

386
00:23:42.500 --> 00:23:45.450
I bet they're sick of it.

387
00:23:45.470 --> 00:23:51.580
But that makes me wonder why they tried so
desperately to save their halfwit leader.

388
00:23:51.680 --> 00:23:55.250
Someone like you doesn't
deserve a ship or a crew.

389
00:23:55.250 --> 00:23:58.290
What good is a helpless,
rubber-brained captain to them?

390
00:23:58.290 --> 00:24:00.790
What can you possibly do?

391
00:24:01.220 --> 00:24:02.920
I can kick your ass!

392
00:24:06.090 --> 00:24:08.470
Well get to it. Ya numbskull.

393
00:24:09.170 --> 00:24:11.100
If he dies I'm gonna kill him!

394
00:24:11.430 --> 00:24:14.060
[USOPP] Heh, heh, heh.
I've got your back, Luffy!

395
00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:16.600
[DOCTOR] Alright, Gum-Gum!

396
00:24:16.600 --> 00:24:18.700
[JOHNNY] Get him Big Bro!

397
00:24:18.700 --> 00:24:21.310
[YOSAKU] Yeah! Go for it!

398
00:24:22.110 --> 00:24:24.570
Cheer all you want, but
it won't change a thing!

399
00:24:26.000 --> 00:24:28.490
Uh! He's got new teeth!

400
00:24:28.620 --> 00:24:30.280
[ARLONG] I'm a shark.

401
00:24:30.290 --> 00:24:32.490
New teeth will grow, one after another.

402
00:24:32.620 --> 00:24:38.370
And with each set they become
stronger and stronger.

403
00:24:38.700 --> 00:24:40.420
Endlessly.

404
00:24:45.080 --> 00:24:45.780
Whoa!

405
00:24:45.780 --> 00:24:48.050
As many as it takes.

406
00:24:49.930 --> 00:24:52.350
[JOHNNY, YOSAKU gasping]

407
00:24:55.490 --> 00:24:59.440
This is but one of the many
gifts we fishmen possess.

408
00:25:01.160 --> 00:25:02.440
That's so cool!

409
00:25:03.400 --> 00:25:08.400
If you haven't yet realized that fishmen
are superior, you will very soon.

410
00:25:12.680 --> 00:25:15.330
Tooth... Attack!

411
00:25:15.330 --> 00:25:16.750
[LUFFY] Huh?

412
00:25:17.330 --> 00:25:19.500
[LUFFY yelping]

413
00:25:21.210 --> 00:25:23.000
[LUFFY] Don't!

414
00:25:24.170 --> 00:25:27.170
– [ARLONG laughs]
– [LUFFY screams]

415
00:25:30.050 --> 00:25:33.090
[JOHNNY, YOSAKU] Big Bro Luffy!

416
00:25:33.600 --> 00:25:36.390
[NAMI gasping]

417
00:25:36.390 --> 00:25:38.680
[SANJI gasping]

418
00:25:38.680 --> 00:25:41.770
[USOPP screams]

419
00:25:41.770 --> 00:25:44.270
[FISHMAN F] Arlong... Please...

420
00:25:45.230 --> 00:25:46.460
... it hurts.

421
00:25:46.460 --> 00:25:48.860
What...? My brother!

422
00:25:50.490 --> 00:25:51.280
[FISHMAN F groans]

423
00:25:51.280 --> 00:25:52.660
[LUFFY sighs]

424
00:25:52.660 --> 00:25:56.490
[ARLONG] You're dead...
You stretchy freak...

425
00:25:56.740 --> 00:26:00.330
How dare you use my injured
brother as a shield!

426
00:26:00.650 --> 00:26:01.780
What're you talkin' about?

427
00:26:01.780 --> 00:26:04.750
You're the one who attacked me,
don't you remember?

428
00:26:04.750 --> 00:26:06.880
[sighs] That was pretty scary.

429
00:26:11.050 --> 00:26:15.100
Don't move a muscle... Rubber man.

430
00:26:15.950 --> 00:26:19.270
Heh. Hey. Now that's
an interesting idea.

431
00:26:19.460 --> 00:26:20.980
He's got an idea?

432
00:26:21.560 --> 00:26:23.270
It's in his brain.

433
00:26:23.460 --> 00:26:25.940
Did he come up with some secret scheme?

434
00:26:24.520 --> 00:26:28.150
[ARLONG groaning]

435
00:26:27.460 --> 00:26:28.690
[ARLONG] Tooth attack!

436
00:26:28.690 --> 00:26:29.940
[LUFFY groans]

437
00:26:29.940 --> 00:26:33.110
– [ARLONG yells]
– [LUFFY groans]

438
00:26:35.740 --> 00:26:36.910
[LUFFY yells]

439
00:26:36.910 --> 00:26:39.040
[ARLONG groans]

440
00:26:51.300 --> 00:26:54.130
Alright!

441
00:26:56.230 --> 00:26:58.590
[ARLONG] You...

442
00:26:58.590 --> 00:27:02.230
You fool. There's no point
in crushing my teeth.

443
00:27:04.070 --> 00:27:05.770
You really don't get it!

444
00:27:07.600 --> 00:27:11.230
Big Bro Luffy, uh, that
can't be very sanitary...

445
00:27:11.940 --> 00:27:14.400
So what?! Now I have shark teeth!

446
00:27:14.400 --> 00:27:18.320
[JOHNNY, YOSAKU gasping]

447
00:27:18.320 --> 00:27:22.750
Really, what were they
expecting? It's Luffy.

448
00:27:24.820 --> 00:27:29.040
[ARLONG] How long do you intend
to keep fooling around?!

449
00:27:30.140 --> 00:27:36.550
[LUFFY screaming]
A shark bit me!

450
00:27:37.110 --> 00:27:39.640
[BOTH] So stop playin' games!

451
00:27:40.610 --> 00:27:42.780
Well it's not like I'm having fun!

452
00:27:42.780 --> 00:27:44.180
[ARLONG] Tooth attack!

453
00:27:44.180 --> 00:27:44.980
[LUFFY grunts]

454
00:27:50.610 --> 00:27:52.110
[ARLONG yells]

455
00:27:56.650 --> 00:28:01.330
[ARLONG yells, chuckles]

456
00:28:03.540 --> 00:28:06.870
[LUFFY yells]

457
00:28:06.870 --> 00:28:09.080
[JOHNNY, YOSAKU] Oh, no!

458
00:28:17.590 --> 00:28:20.470
Gotcha! And now we're even. [laughs]

459
00:28:21.500 --> 00:28:24.680
So you used my teeth... [grunts]

460
00:28:25.930 --> 00:28:28.970
But... Your puny jaws
aren't strong enough.

461
00:28:28.970 --> 00:28:33.470
Now listen... Sharp as my teeth are,
they're only useful when they come

462
00:28:33.470 --> 00:28:35.610
with powerful jaws like mine.

463
00:28:35.610 --> 00:28:37.360
Then they're deadly!

464
00:28:37.360 --> 00:28:38.820
[LUFFY groans]

465
00:28:39.850 --> 00:28:43.080
Ahh! Big Bro's gonna
get his arm bitten off!

466
